    "game_m_per_mm": 0.04375,
    "held_scale": 0.125,
    "held_scale_note": "1/8. Game size of a held item = its nano build x this. At 1/6 a gun of real proportions is under two studs thick and cannot be built in bricks; at 1/8 a 42 mm receiver is two nano studs. Tuned by eye in the game."
  },
